#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_exchange__rate_margin
msgid ""
"Margin earned on the rates: the value of the notes received at the rate of "
"Odoo of the day less the received value, plus the handed value less the "
"value of the notes handed back at the rate of Odoo. Realized when the "
"foreign notes are deposited or revalued; the commission plus the rate margin"
" is the income of the operation."
msgstr ""
"Margin earned on the rates: the value of the notes received at the rate of "
"Odoo of the day less the received value, plus the handed value less the "
"value of the notes handed back at the rate of Odoo. Realized when the "
"foreign notes are deposited or revalued; the commission plus the rate margin"
" is the income of the operation."

#. module: pos_nm_currency_exchange
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:pos_nm_currency_exchange.field_pos_nm_currency_setting__exchange_sell_margin_percent
msgid ""
"Margin of the exchange counter on the notes of this currency it hands back, "
"with the rate of Odoo: they are handed back at the rate of Odoo divided by 1"
" + this margin, so the counter sells them above the market. The notes "
"received keep the cash rate (the rate of Odoo with the Cash Rate Margin, the"
" buy margin). A new currency starts from its Cash Rate Margin (a negative "
"Cash Rate Margin m gives -m / (1 + m / 100), which keeps its sell rate: 2.04"
" for -2), as the currencies upgraded from 20.0.1; change it afterwards. With"
" a fixed cash rate, the notes are handed back at the lower of the fixed rate"
" and the fixed change rate, and this margin is not used."
msgstr ""
"Margin of the exchange counter on the notes of this currency it hands back, "
"with the rate of Odoo: they are handed back at the rate of Odoo divided by 1"
" + this margin, so the counter sells them above the market. The notes "
"received keep the cash rate (the rate of Odoo with the Cash Rate Margin, the"
" buy margin). A new currency starts from its Cash Rate Margin (a negative "
"Cash Rate Margin m gives -m / (1 + m / 100), which keeps its sell rate: 2.04"
" for -2), as the currencies upgraded from 20.0.1; change it afterwards. With"
" a fixed cash rate, the notes are handed back at the lower of the fixed rate"
" and the fixed change rate, and this margin is not used."

